THE ONE-SENTENCE DEFINITION
Naya Notes is the memory system that allows Naya to capture important ideas, decisions, events, discoveries, lessons, progress, problems, successes, and personal context so useful knowledge does not disappear when a conversation ends.
Naya Notes transforms moments into memory.
Memory into knowledge.
Knowledge into context.
Context into better decisions.
And better decisions into better outcomes.

THE HUMAN IDEA BEHIND NAYA NOTES
Imagine being able to say:
“Naya, make a note of this.”
And know that the thought won't simply disappear into yesterday's conversation.
Imagine:
“Naya, I just had an aha moment. Save this.”
“Naya, remember this decision.”
“Naya, make a note that this worked.”
“Naya, make a note that this failed.”
“Naya, document what we learned.”
“Naya, remember why we chose this.”
“Naya, what did I figure out about this last month?”
“Naya, what were we talking about Wednesday around 3 PM?”
“Naya, show me everything we've learned about this project.”
“Naya, what mistakes have we already made here?”
“Naya, what ideas have I had about this?”
That is the promise of Naya Notes.
Your thoughts do not have to disappear simply because the conversation ended.

