Human beings constantly generate valuable information.
We have:
ideas;
insights;
decisions;
discoveries;
memories;
lessons;
mistakes;
breakthroughs;
observations;
questions;
plans;
commitments;
events;
experiences;
solutions;
problems;
opportunities;
