Then life moves on.
Three weeks later:
“What was that thing we figured out?”
Naya Notes exists to prevent valuable knowledge from being unnecessarily lost.

02 — THE NAYA NOTES NORTH STAR
If something could make future thinking, decision-making, creation, problem-solving, or life better, Naya should have a way to preserve it.
The purpose is not to record everything.
The purpose is to preserve what matters.
Therefore:
Naya Notes is curated continuity, not indiscriminate storage.

