Topic structures should remain flexible.
Naya should not force a Note into a category that doesn't fit.

19 — PROJECT ORGANIZATION
Where a Note belongs to a known project, associate it with that project.
For example:
Project: MAXESS
Project: Human Maximus Codex
Project: NayaNET
Project: Naya
